  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be maintained in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:\r\rLocation and Block Plan  - AR-012 Rev 01\rExisting Floor and Elevations Plan  - AR-011 Rev 01\r\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r",
    "The use of the property as a House in Multiple Occupation hereby approved shall be occupied by a maximum of 4 people at any one time and shall not be subdivided or occupied as self-contained units.\r\rReason: To accord with the stipulations of definition as a House of Multiple Occupation and to safeguard the residential character of the surrounding area.\r",
    "No independent cooking or laundry facilities shall be installed in any of the respective bedrooms and the communal kitchen, dining and living rooms shall be retained in perpetuity.\r\rReason: To accord with the stipulations of definition as a House of Multiple Occupation and to safeguard the residential character of the surrounding area.\r"
